  S3["3. No false '5h window ends in 15 min'.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S4["4. After the old reset the 5h row goes for good: a<br/>reply without five_hour hides it.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S5["5. A new Ultra user sees the weekly alone after<br/>the first reply.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S6["6. Max and Pro keep both windows.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S7["7. Before the first reply a new Ultra user still<br/>sees a '5h window' row, and the Install text is<br/>titled 'Weekly and 5h window'.<br/><i>friction</i>"]:::friction
